    // Syntax colour scheme. Presets and resolution live in SyntaxSchemes; the
    // chosen state is per-browser in localStorage (passage.js), like the
    // theme, and the resolved palettes are painted as --syntax-* overrides so
    // the editor, outline and reference panel all follow it.
